  {
    "key": "75:30",
    "publishedBody": "その日、あなたの主へと駆りたてられる。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:31",
    "publishedBody": "真実を受け入れずにいた。礼拝もしなかった。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:32",
    "publishedBody": "むしろ嘘であるとし、背を向けた。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:33",
    "publishedBody": "自分の身内の許では、いばり散らしていた。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:34",
    "publishedBody": "災禍あれ、あなたに災禍あれ。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:35",
    "publishedBody": "災禍あれ、あなたに災禍あれ。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:36",
    "publishedBody": "人間は、[何の目的もなく]そのままに放っておかれると思っているのか。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:37",
    "publishedBody": "元は放たれた精のひとしずくではなかったのか。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:38",
    "publishedBody": "そののち血の凝ったものとなり、それから形あるものに創造され、",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
  {
    "key": "75:39",
    "publishedBody": "そののち一対の雌雄にされたのではなかったのか。",
    "pages": [
      519
    ],
    "noteAnchors": [],
    "requiredNotes": [],
    "editionId": "ja-tokyo-camii-pdf01_03-2022-02-01",
    "classification": "published-Quran-translation"
  },
